## 4. Proposed Changes

### Phase 1: Design Foundation

#### [MODIFY] [globals.css](file:///Users/ofekstrogo/Library/CloudStorage/GoogleDrive-ofekstudent99@gmail.com/My%20Drive/4.%20%D7%90%D7%99%D7%A9%D7%99/Python%20Exam%20Perperation/python-study-platform/src/app/globals.css)
Complete overhaul of the design token system:
- Replace all current CSS custom properties with the Stitch "Digital Atheneum" palette
- Update `@theme inline` block with new Tailwind color mappings
- Replace current neon-glow effects with new tonal layering system
- Add glassmorphism utility classes
- Add the signature 135° gradient CTA mixin
- Implement the "Ghost Border" utility (outline-variant @ 15%)
- Update scrollbar styling to match new palette
- Keep all RTL/LTR handling rules **unchanged**
- Keep all animation keyframes, update colors only

**Current → New token mapping:**
```diff
- --primary: #2bee6c;
+ --primary: #00f77b;            /* primary-container from Stitch */
+ --primary-soft: #d2ffd5;       /* primary from Stitch */
+ --primary-gradient-end: #63ff93; /* primary-fixed */
- --background-dark: #102216;
+ --background: #0b160f;
- --surface-dark: #1a2e20;
+ --surface-container: #17221b;
+ --surface-container-low: #131e17;
+ --surface-container-high: #212d25;
+ --surface-container-highest: #2c372f;
+ --surface-container-lowest: #06100a;
- --border-dark: #23482f;
+ --outline-variant: #3b4b3c;
- --text-muted: #92c9a4;
+ --on-surface: #d9e6da;
+ --on-surface-variant: #b9cbb8;
- --neon-glow: rgba(43, 238, 108, 0.4);
+ --primary-glow: rgba(0, 247, 123, 0.15);
```

