## 5. What We Are NOT Changing

> [!CAUTION]
> These elements must remain **completely untouched**:

- All Hebrew text strings (titles, labels, instructions, feedback messages)
- `src/data/` — All curriculum JSON, lesson data, exam questions, final exams
- `src/utils/` — bidi helpers and utility functions
- Quiz/exam business logic (scoring, shuffling, timing, navigation)
- Interactive code simulator logic (PyTutor, MemoryGrid)
- Route structure (`/`, `/learn/[id]`, `/exam`, `/exam/final`, `/exam/timed`, `/guides/*`)
- RTL layout direction
- `package.json` dependencies (except adding Google Fonts for Space Grotesk)

---

## 6. New Dependencies

| Package | Purpose |
|---|---|
| `@next/font` (already via `next/font`) | Add Space Grotesk + Inter |

> No new npm packages required. Space Grotesk and Inter will be loaded via `next/font/google`, which is already available.

