## 8. Open Questions

> [!IMPORTANT]
> 1. **Should we install Fira Code** for code blocks, or keep the current `Courier New` monospace? The Stitch design recommends Fira Code.
> 2. **Mobile bottom nav:** The Stitch designs are mobile-first (780px viewport). Should we keep the current mobile bottom nav bar pattern or switch to a hamburger menu for desktop?
> 3. **Transition strategy:** Should we do this as one big PR or would you prefer incremental changes (Phase 1 first, review, then continue)?

---

## 9. Verification Plan

### Build Verification
```bash
npm run build   # Must complete with 0 errors
npm run dev      # Visual review
```

### Manual Verification
- [ ] All pages render correctly in dark mode
- [ ] Hebrew text displays properly (RTL)
- [ ] Code blocks remain LTR
- [ ] Quiz/exam flow works end-to-end
- [ ] Timed exam timer functions correctly
- [ ] Module navigation intact
- [ ] Mobile responsive layouts
- [ ] Glassmorphism header visible on scroll
- [ ] No broken styles or missing tokens
